  STRUCT('ARROW SELF DRIVE', '02206442', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER B, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 02206442 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 03794992. Confidence Medium. Basis: Kirklees Council -- Huddersfield itself -- states 02206442 ARROW COMMERCIAL CENTRE (HUDDERSFIELD) LIMITED for \'Arrow Self Drive\', and the payer York is a Yorkshire council hiring vehicles. The tier-4 candidate is a Reading company with the exact name. Geography and a local buyer against an exact name. GBP 103,714.92.'),
  STRUCT('NRS HEALTHCARE', '01948041', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 01948041 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 11480843. Confidence Medium-low. Basis: NRS is Nottingham Rehab Supplies. Torbay Council states 01948041 NOTTINGHAM REHAB LIMITED, whose wholesale SIC fits community-equipment supply better than the candidate\'s. Both companies are in liquidation and the evidence is one award from another buyer. GBP 86,611.44.'),
  STRUCT('TALK TALK BUSINESS', '11347230', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 11347230 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 05821647. Confidence Medium. Basis: The two tier-4 candidates tie and are both wrong: a publisher, and a telecoms company in liquidation. 11347230 TALKTALK BUSINESS DIRECT LIMITED is an active telecoms company that one buyer states. \'TALKTALK\' written as one word defeats token-set scoring. GBP 77,923.93.'),
  STRUCT('IDAS', '04984337', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 04984337 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 02792217. Confidence High. Basis: IDAS is Independent Domestic Abuse Services, registered earlier as YORK WOMEN\'S AID; the payer is the Ministry of Justice, which funds victims\' services, and North Yorkshire Council states 04984337. The tier-4 candidate IDAS LIMITED is a Southampton software company. GBP 58,379.19.'),
  STRUCT('MAIL SOLUTIONS', '02413935', 'left_open', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. LEFT OPEN: the evidence does not separate the candidates, so no company is attributed and the name stays in the open queue. Basis: 02413935, 05157725 and MAIL SOLUTIONS GROUP LIMITED share one registered address: one group, three entities, and nothing from the payer separates them. Either choice attributes the money to the right group; neither can be shown to be the right entity. GBP 46,439.95.'),
  STRUCT('SMART SURVEY LTD', '04885155', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 04885155 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 15187550. Confidence High. Basis: The payer\'s own award: the Ministry of Justice names \'Smart Survey Ltd\' in Contracts Finder and states 04885155 -- the row-3 class. The tier-4 candidate SURVEY SMART LTD was incorporated in 2023 with a reversed name. GBP 42,000.00.'),
  STRUCT('TUDOR ENVIRONMENTAL', '08693251', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 08693251 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 14282608. Confidence Medium. Basis: The tier-4 candidate TUDOR ENVIRONMENTAL LTD is a DORMANT company and cannot be the payee of trading payments -- a structural reject. Haringey states 08693251 TUDOR (UK) LTD for \'Tudor Environmental\', consistent with a trading name. GBP 31,423.31.'),
  STRUCT('WESTFIELD HEALTH', '10034914', 'left_open', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. LEFT OPEN: the evidence does not separate the candidates, so no company is attributed and the name stays in the open queue. Basis: The buyer-stated 05696250 is REWARD GATEWAY, formerly ASPERITY EMPLOYEE BENEFITS -- probably a benefits platform recorded by mistake. Westfield\'s own group holds several entities at one registered address, and the single DfT payment does not separate them. GBP 25,381.88.'),
  STRUCT('ACORN ANALYTICAL SERVICES', '04723192', 'left_open', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. LEFT OPEN: the evidence does not separate the candidates, so no company is attributed and the name stays in the open queue. Basis: Two buyers state different companies: one 04723192 (Cleckheaton, nearer York), one 08340465 (Northampton). Geography leans to 04723192, but that is not an established class. GBP 4,350.00.'),
  STRUCT('EVERSHEDS SUTHERLAND', 'OC304065', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE OC304065 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 10501301. Confidence Medium. Basis: Legal fees are billed by the practising LLP; OC304065 was EVERSHEDS LLP until 2017. One buyer states OC304065. The other states 10501301 but names the supplier \'Eversheds Sutherland LLP\', so its own entry contradicts itself. GBP 3,261.00.'),
  STRUCT('S J ENGINEERING', '04472451', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER C, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE TIER-4 CANDIDATE 04472451, resolving a hard-rule-2 tie (candidate_count 2) by user decision on evidence -- override authorised 2026-09-24, scoped to S J ENGINEERING and INTERNATIONAL MOTORS only. Confidence High. Basis: Same-payer bridge: Bristol also pays \'S J ENGINEERING LTD\', which resolves by rule at tier 2 to 04472451. The tie at 1.00 with J S ENGINEERING LIMITED is a word-order artefact of token-set scoring, and that rival is a non-trading company. Resolves an ambiguity by evidence -- see the note on hard rule 2. GBP 2,054.00.'),
